{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13812","headline":"题卢道土房 · 顾况","name":"题卢道土房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋砧响落木，共坐茅君家。\n唯见两童子，门外汲井花。\n空坛静白日，神鼎飞丹砂。\n麈尾拂霜草，金铃摇霁霞。\n上章尘世隔，看弈桐阴斜。\n稽首问仙要，黄精堪饵花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}